  "name": "Green Beans with Bread Crumbs",
  "subtitle": "Tender green beans with herbed crumbs and Parmesan",
  "description": "Green beans are simmered until tender, then tossed with seasoned crumbs, herbs, olive oil, and Parmesan for a savory Italian-inspired side.",
